\[a_{r}^{h}(\mathbf{u},\mathbf{v})=a(\mathbf{u},\mathbf{v})+r(\rho_{h}( \operatorname{div}\mathbf{u}),\rho_{h}(\operatorname{div}\mathbf{v})).\]

